import lib/cadkernel/brep_slice.dl
import lib/cadkernel/brep_make.dl
import lib/cadkernel/brep_presspull.dl

function check cad slice {boolean:condition} code {integer:code}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, code)

function check cad slice body {cad body:body} code {integer:code}:
    execute:
        set flaws to the cad flaws of body
        check cad slice ((the length of flaws) = 0) code code
        free flaws

function a cad slice test cutter for {cad surface:surfaceValue} forward {boolean:forwardValue}:
    execute:
        set resultBody to an empty cad body
        set lumpKey to the cad body key after inserting (a cad lump with provenance (the synthesized cad provenance)) into resultBody
        set shellKey to the cad body key after inserting (a cad shell owned by lumpKey with provenance (the synthesized cad provenance)) into resultBody
        set surfaceKey to the cad body key after inserting surfaceValue into resultBody
        set faceKey to the cad body key after inserting (a cad face on surfaceKey forward forwardValue owned by shellKey with provenance (the synthesized cad provenance)) into resultBody
        set lumpNode to the cad node pointer for lumpKey in resultBody
        append shellKey to (lumpNode's shells's values)
        set shellNode to the cad node pointer for shellKey in resultBody
        append faceKey to (shellNode's faces's values)
        append lumpKey to resultBody's roots
        return resultBody

set made to the cad cuboid at (the cad zero vector3) with size (a cad vector3 with x 4.0, y 2.0 and z 2.0)
set cuttingPlane to the cad orthonormal plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x 1.5, y 0.0 and z 0.0), x axis (the cad y axis) and normal (the cad x axis)
check cad slice cuttingPlane's valid code 11
set sliced to the cad plane slice of (made's value) by (cuttingPlane's value)
check cad slice sliced's valid code 12
check cad slice sliced's divided code 13
check cad slice body sliced's negative code 14
check cad slice body sliced's positive code 15
set negativeBounds to the cad bounds of sliced's negative
set positiveBounds to the cad bounds of sliced's positive
check cad slice negativeBounds's valid code 16
check cad slice positiveBounds's valid code 17
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (negativeBounds's value's high's x - 1.5)) < 1e-8) code 18
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (positiveBounds's value's low's x - 1.5)) < 1e-8) code 19
check cad slice ((the cad containment of (a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 1.0 and z 1.0) in sliced's negative within 1e-9) = the inside cad containment) code 20
check cad slice ((the cad containment of (a cad vector3 with x 3.0, y 1.0 and z 1.0) in sliced's positive within 1e-9) = the inside cad containment) code 21
check cad slice ((the cad count of made's value's faces) = 6) code 22
print "a_plane_splits_a_box_into_two_valid_solids" as a line

set tangentPlane to the cad orthonormal plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x 4.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0), x axis (the cad y axis) and normal (the cad x axis)
set tangent to the cad plane slice of (made's value) by (tangentPlane's value)
check cad slice tangent's valid code 31
check cad slice (tangent's divided = false) code 32
print "a_tangent_plane_does_not_split_a_box" as a line

set diagonalNormal to the cad normalization of (a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 1.0 and z 0.0)
set diagonalPlane to the cad orthonormal plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x 2.0, y 1.0 and z 0.0), x axis (the cad z axis) and normal diagonalNormal's value
set diagonal to the cad plane slice of (made's value) by (diagonalPlane's value)
check cad slice diagonal's valid code 41
check cad slice diagonal's divided code 42
check cad slice body diagonal's negative code 43
check cad slice body diagonal's positive code 44
print "an_oblique_plane_keeps_both_capped_halves_consistent" as a line

set surveyOrigin to a cad vector3 with x 512345.678, y 4512345.678 and z 91.5
set surveyMade to the cad cuboid at surveyOrigin with size (a cad vector3 with x 4.0, y 2.0 and z 2.0)
set surveyPlane to the cad orthonormal plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x (surveyOrigin's x + 1.5), y surveyOrigin's y and z surveyOrigin's z), x axis (the cad y axis) and normal (the cad x axis)
set survey to the cad plane slice of (surveyMade's value) by (surveyPlane's value)
check cad slice survey's valid code 51
check cad slice survey's divided code 52
check cad slice body survey's negative code 53
check cad slice body survey's positive code 54
print "plane_slicing_remains_stable_at_survey_coordinates" as a line

set emptySlice to the cad plane slice of (an empty cad body) by (cuttingPlane's value)
check cad slice emptySlice's valid code 61
check cad slice (emptySlice's divided = false) code 62
set invalidPlane to a cad plane with origin (the cad zero vector3), x axis (the cad zero vector3) and y axis (the cad y axis)
set invalidSlice to the cad plane slice of made's value by invalidPlane
check cad slice (invalidSlice's valid = false) code 63
check cad slice (invalidSlice's snag = cad imprint cut refused snag) code 64
print "empty_and_invalid_inputs_keep_their_distinct_results" as a line

set sheetCurves to an empty list of (the type of (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from the cad zero vector2 to the cad zero vector2)))
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 0.0))) to sheetCurves
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 0.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 2.0))) to sheetCurves
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 2.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 2.0))) to sheetCurves
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 2.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0))) to sheetCurves
set sheetLoops to a list containing (a cad presspull curve loop from sheetCurves)
set sheetMade to the cad planar region on (the cad xy plane) with sheetLoops
check cad slice sheetMade's valid code 71
set sheetSlice to the cad plane slice of (sheetMade's value) by (cuttingPlane's value)
check cad slice sheetSlice's valid code 72
check cad slice sheetSlice's divided code 73
check cad slice body sheetSlice's negative code 74
check cad slice body sheetSlice's positive code 75
check cad slice ((the cad count of sheetSlice's negative's faces) = 1) code 76
check cad slice ((the cad count of sheetSlice's positive's faces) = 1) code 77
print "an_open_sheet_retains_two_open_boundaries" as a line

set cutterFrame to a cad plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x 1.5, y -1.0 and z -1.0), x axis (the cad y axis) and y axis (the cad z axis)
set cutterCurves to an empty list of (the type of (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from the cad zero vector2 to the cad zero vector2)))
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 0.0))) to cutterCurves
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 0.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 4.0))) to cutterCurves
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 4.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 4.0))) to cutterCurves
append (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 4.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0))) to cutterCurves
set cutterLoops to a list containing (a cad presspull curve loop from cutterCurves)
set cutterMade to the cad planar region on cutterFrame with cutterLoops
check cad slice cutterMade's valid code 81
set surfaceSlice to the cad surface slice of (made's value) by (cutterMade's value)
check cad slice surfaceSlice's valid code 82
check cad slice surfaceSlice's divided code 83
check cad slice body surfaceSlice's negative code 84
check cad slice body surfaceSlice's positive code 85
set surfaceNegativeBounds to the cad bounds of surfaceSlice's negative
set surfacePositiveBounds to the cad bounds of surfaceSlice's positive
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (surfaceNegativeBounds's value's high's x - 1.5)) < 1e-8) code 86
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (surfacePositiveBounds's value's low's x - 1.5)) < 1e-8) code 87
set invalidSurfaceSlice to the cad surface slice of (made's value) by (made's value)
check cad slice (invalidSurfaceSlice's valid = false) code 88
check cad slice (invalidSurfaceSlice's snag = cad imprint cut refused snag) code 89
print "an_oriented_planar_sheet_caps_a_surface_slice" as a line

set analyticFrame to the cad xy plane
set planeCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of analyticFrame) forward true
set cylinderCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of (a cad cylinder with base analyticFrame and radius 3.0)) forward true
set coneCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of (a cad cone with base analyticFrame, radius 3.0 and half angle 0.4)) forward true
set sphereCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of (a cad sphere with frame analyticFrame and radius 3.0)) forward true
set torusCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of (a cad torus with frame analyticFrame, major radius 3.0 and minor radius 1.0)) forward true
set reversedSphereCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of (a cad sphere with frame analyticFrame and radius 3.0)) forward false
set planeSide to the cad surface side of planeCutter at (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 2.0)
set cylinderSide to the cad surface side of cylinderCutter at (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0)
set coneSide to the cad surface side of coneCutter at (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0)
set sphereSide to the cad surface side of sphereCutter at (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0)
set torusSide to the cad surface side of torusCutter at (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0)
set reversedSphereSide to the cad surface side of reversedSphereCutter at (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0)
check cad slice (((((planeSide's valid and cylinderSide's valid) and coneSide's valid) and sphereSide's valid) and torusSide's valid) and reversedSphereSide's valid) code 91
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (planeSide's value - 2.0)) < 1e-12) code 92
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (cylinderSide's value - 2.0)) < 1e-12) code 93
check cad slice (coneSide's value > 0.0) code 94
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (sphereSide's value - 2.0)) < 1e-12) code 95
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (torusSide's value - 1.0)) < 1e-12) code 96
check cad slice ((the absolute value of (reversedSphereSide's value + 2.0)) < 1e-12) code 97
print "analytic_surface_sides_follow_face_orientation" as a line

set smallSphereCutter to a cad slice test cutter for (the cad surface of (a cad sphere with frame (a cad plane with origin (a cad vector3 with x 2.0, y 1.0 and z 0.0), x axis (the cad x axis) and y axis (the cad y axis)) and radius 0.75)) forward true
set sphereSheetSlice to the cad surface slice of (sheetMade's value) by smallSphereCutter
check cad slice sphereSheetSlice's valid code 101
check cad slice sphereSheetSlice's divided code 102
check cad slice body sphereSheetSlice's negative code 103
check cad slice body sphereSheetSlice's positive code 104
print "a_sphere_sheet_divides_an_open_planar_region" as a line
